# Gentoo HARDENED kernel sources. sys-kernel/hardened-sources (grsecurity) was
# removed from the tree in 2017; the modern Gentoo hardened kernel is
# gentoo-sources built under the hardened profile + the KSPP/SELinux config
# fragment (specs-x86/kernel/hardened-k8s.config, + gpu.config for GPU roles).
# The `symlink` USE makes the ebuild point /usr/src/linux at these sources on
# install, so the kernel
# build step finds them even if run right after the package emerge.
sys-kernel/gentoo-sources symlink
